{"acceptance_reason":"GATES_PASSED","acceptance_status":"ACCEPTED","case_id":"CASE-V5-AUTO","content_sha256":"a4442ab7c194ccf8b94745da8d19d25d3f3cdfe2615dd0ca67031e3b11e84b22","context_id":"CTX-V6R2-AUTO-01","evidence_id":"EV-V6R2-AUTO-01","evidence_link_id":"EL-V6R2-AUTO-01","locator":"html_block:43","original_quote":"th America is once again the largest sales region, recording an increase of one per cent compared to the previous year. In China, 56,887 cars were handed over to customers (-28 per cent). The decline is mainly due to the continuing challenging economic situation in this region. Despite this, Porsche is sticking to its value-based sales approach. The aim is to balance demand and sales. The Overseas and Emerging Markets again developed positively with growth of si","published_at":"2025-01-13T00:00:00+01:00","publisher":"Porsche AG","retrieved_at":"2026-08-14T01:33:20+00:00","snapshot_path":"exports/v6-second-round/acquisition/snapshots/c3d7b3f74984e696e231557e1490566df1a563a8af4c139a8c2688943a4ff1f0.html","snapshot_sha256":"c3d7b3f74984e696e231557e1490566df1a563a8af4c139a8c2688943a4ff1f0","source_id":"SRC-V6R2-PORSCHE-2024","source_tier":"T2","source_url":"https://newsroom.porsche.com/en/2025/company/porsche-deliveries-2024-38358.html","supports_node_ids":["NODE-V5-AUTO-W2"],"temporal_role":"POST_EVENT_VALIDATION","visual_review_status":"NOT_APPLICABLE"}
{"acceptance_reason":"GATES_PASSED","acceptance_status":"ACCEPTED","case_id":"CASE-V5-FRAUD-ANTHOLOGY","content_sha256":"f2b6d82ffc4fc495d1ff8e96463490f35bb7cf4b7aa1163b124311ea72c2d0a1","context_id":"CTX-V6R2-FRAUD-01","evidence_id":"EV-V6R2-FRAUD-01","evidence_link_id":"EL-V6R2-FRAUD-01","locator":"html_block:7","original_quote":"獐子岛公司在2014年、2015年已连续两年亏损的情况下，客观上利用海底 库存及采捕情况 难发现、难调查、难核实的特点，不以实际采捕海域为依据进行成本结转，导致财务报告严重失真，2016年通过少记录成本、营业外支出的方法将利润由亏损披露为盈利，2017年将以前年度已采捕海域列入核销 海域或减值海域 ，夸大 亏损 幅度，此外，公司还涉及《年终盘点报告》和《核销公告》披露不真实、秋测披露不真实、不及时披露业绩变化情况等多项违法事实 ， 违法情节特别严重， 严重扰乱证券市场秩序、严重损害投资者利益， 社会影响极其恶劣。","published_at":"2020-06-24T00:00:00+08:00","publisher":"中国证券监督管理委员会","retrieved_at":"2026-08-14T01:33:23+00:00","snapshot_path":"exports/v6-second-round/acquisition/snapshots/fd8ffa683315449ac55e8c936390ec81e23c73fac6b916179b95d375dede4b34.html","snapshot_sha256":"fd8ffa683315449ac55e8c936390ec81e23c73fac6b916179b95d375dede4b34","source_id":"SRC-V6R2-ZHANGZIDAO-CSRC","source_tier":"T1","source_url":"https://www.csrc.gov.cn/csrc/c100028/c1000756/content.shtml","supports_node_ids":["NODE-V5-FRAUD-ANTHOLOGY-W1"],"temporal_role":"POST_EVENT_VALIDATION","visual_review_status":"NOT_APPLICABLE"}
{"acceptance_reason":"GATES_PASSED","acceptance_status":"ACCEPTED","case_id":"CASE-V5-FRAUD-ANTHOLOGY","content_sha256":"7ccdd61abdeb2ada335a0dabf4c806f0163abbd1328a6b9287c3d537e05c1789","context_id":"CTX-V6R2-FRAUD-02","evidence_id":"EV-V6R2-FRAUD-02","evidence_link_id":"EL-V6R2-FRAUD-02","locator":"html_block:8","original_quote":"记录的全过程追溯。证监会统筹执法力量，走访渔政监督、水产科研等部门寻求专业支持，依托科技执法手段开展全面深入调查。 獐子岛公司 每月虾夷扇贝成本结转的依据为当月捕捞区域，在无逐日采捕区域记录可以核验的情况下，证监会 借助卫星定位数据，对公司27条采捕船只 数百 余万条海上航行定位数据进行分析，委托两家第三方专业机构运用计算机技术还原了采捕船只的真实航行轨迹，复原了公司最近两年真实的采捕海域，进而确定实际采捕面积，并据此认定獐子岛公司成本、 营业外支出、 利润 等 存在虚假。","published_at":"2020-06-24T00:00:00+08:00","publisher":"中国证券监督管理委员会","retrieved_at":"2026-08-14T01:33:23+00:00","snapshot_path":"exports/v6-second-round/acquisition/snapshots/fd8ffa683315449ac55e8c936390ec81e23c73fac6b916179b95d375dede4b34.html","snapshot_sha256":"fd8ffa683315449ac55e8c936390ec81e23c73fac6b916179b95d375dede4b34","source_id":"SRC-V6R2-ZHANGZIDAO-CSRC","source_tier":"T1","source_url":"https://www.csrc.gov.cn/csrc/c100028/c1000756/content.shtml","supports_node_ids":["NODE-V5-FRAUD-ANTHOLOGY-W1"],"temporal_role":"POST_EVENT_VALIDATION","visual_review_status":"NOT_APPLICABLE"}
