{"acceptance_reason":"GATES_PASSED","acceptance_status":"ACCEPTED","case_id":"CASE-V5-ZHAOWEI","content_sha256":"9cb9c907d60e7e1105be6b2e2b5db5a0a17ab55bfaab24427827b04572daf691","context_id":"CTX-V6R2-ZHAOWEI-03","evidence_id":"EV-V6R2-ZHAOWEI-03","evidence_link_id":"EL-V6R2-ZHAOWEI-03","locator":"html_block:52","original_quote":"余均为借入资金，杠杆比例高达51倍 。在本次控股权转让过程中，龙薇传媒未进行资金的充分筹备，在境内可支付资金有限的情况下，运用高杠杆收购境内上市公司，在股权转让协议签署后才着手寻求金融机构融资。 2016年12月23日至2017年4月1日，短时间内， 控股权转让 事项不断变更， 由控股权转让变更为5%股权转让，后又完全终止股权转让，且双方不追究任何违约责任。","published_at":"2018-04-11T00:00:00+08:00","publisher":"中国证券监督管理委员会","retrieved_at":"2026-08-14T01:33:42+00:00","snapshot_path":"exports/v6-second-round/acquisition/snapshots/496278120f5b7d6cf944e37eedbc64f5ffd644ed845716029db9c9fdc5bbb8a1.html","snapshot_sha256":"496278120f5b7d6cf944e37eedbc64f5ffd644ed845716029db9c9fdc5bbb8a1","source_id":"SRC-V6R2-ZHAOWEI-CSRC","source_tier":"T1","source_url":"https://www.csrc.gov.cn/csrc/c101928/c1042604/content.shtml","supports_node_ids":["NODE-V5-ZHAOWEI-W3"],"temporal_role":"POST_EVENT_VALIDATION","visual_review_status":"NOT_APPLICABLE"}
